parables.phext — Will's parables, kept whole.

A parable is a page, not a cell: each one lives entire in its
scroll, in the teller's words. This home scroll is the index;
its entries are computed from the sources at build time.
Sources: ~/workspace/phext/parables/*.md (edit the sources,
never the .phext). Builder: build_parables_phext.py.

